{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女星丁小芹過去因涉入販售仿冒名牌包案件，2020年10月遭最高法院駁回上訴定讞，並於同年12月1日正式報到入監服刑，入獄服刑約一年四個月後，2022年4月獲准假釋出獄。丁小芹淡出演藝圈已多年，近期被發現已悄悄重回時尚零售領域，經營起直播帶貨與網絡選品生意，低調重啟創業人生。</p><p>她個人社群平台已停擺多年，上一次在鏡頭前大方展露正臉更是要追溯到七年前。沒想到，18日她竟無預警在社群平台上更新近況，不僅大方秀出正面照，更感性對老友們告白。</p><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹又久違曬近照（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188879954230644736961870.jpeg/140UtoVk2WXCGGblyBjpLV2xDMB9hu6pmFwxGJhcMRg\"/><figcaption>丁小芹又久違曬近照（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多丁小芹的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"台灣女星丁小芹妝容打扮濃艷，風格有幾分似日本天后濱崎步（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261335432826880143875.jpeg/fNmXO4XlJMQX-DaTeDFRMB_MU_yUlXu0hdak5IXWpOQ\"/><figcaption>台灣女星丁小芹妝容打扮濃艷，風格有幾分似日本天后濱崎步（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣女星丁小芹妝容打扮濃艷，風格有幾分似日本天后濱崎步（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261337634967552786459.jpeg/N_qT3NAPbB-wvy_NxfzoBq_s8Rj1RiWwNi1sGjYtbBo\"/><figcaption>台灣女星丁小芹妝容打扮濃艷，風格有幾分似日本天后濱崎步（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她的網店主要賣名牌嘢，後被拍擋懷疑是假貨，之後被警方逮捕（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261339413483520065172.jpeg/jEX_LYTcvVZrwpGZiidFmLt0IyId3K_Yqnicz6p4nM8\"/><figcaption>她的網店主要賣名牌嘢，後被拍擋懷疑是假貨，之後被警方逮捕（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹被告上法庭後曾在FB作出道歉聲明，豈料其後與網友談起此事時，卻盡顯對法官的不屑（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261341250719744150467.jpeg/IF-u9Vlrr4PCB5rTL-5jxhc9V3Zjg3CDtTZTpbU2U6U\"/><figcaption>丁小芹被告上法庭後曾在FB作出道歉聲明，豈料其後與網友談起此事時，卻盡顯對法官的不屑（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261343578689536145903.jpeg/rgEiXh2T4L11fZU13IkZVeE6_25HBXR3G2NT8RtjU_E\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261345491423232528761.jpeg/KGOLrJ-jhxKDJNWZQDXMtAa-O-FGhsEJbPYEkWz2BJE\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261347534180352714830.jpeg/xuWmH973RFx187JI405s26TqMrOMmIvByTPCAckzwgE\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201125/408261349610491904384027.jpeg/UlcdJtwJ3BKkQRSoJG4cnqaLzNkSS9b6QHFEnEBxRJw\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（FB@丁小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881426951442432472035.jpeg/8_iap4fQ1XkbCtqruoCe5hadM34iu5o_udY9o7nWPaM\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881429237469184364798.jpeg/xzjjI6v7wHoTXi8Xb0EO2C4HA_MgcTzVtEYC1bRGAtU\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881431204728832371209.jpeg/gyNmvQpk2pLV7aA4krQWbwyJ-QlRXtQzPmD4Uz5g-FM\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881433499144192719563.jpeg/-3bf_U1psSbopjXTfuwXWVfM3MUzBzb4zt2LR87di0c\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881435701284864471926.jpeg/SFVvsdHBaS0mOHxHh10Oh5hfkduuLf5bkcZpDpHGaQ4\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881423067516928802517.jpeg/s1qzv2F_cKI8PRlvCsK-tqx4ZzafkF7RaXErv2lxK78\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881425416458240128390.jpeg/aPGJlzol_Ozt8CQK5UF9ajA6itRKA2-0kYIhYpGCIWI\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188881427673124864170589.jpeg/QgLM9OuMBps4vVTIG7Dj2IeJ2_jLOZMgnvb-2p72_to\"/><figcaption>丁小芹（微博＠T-ANA小芹）</figcaption></figure><p>逆齡神顏曝光 皮膚白皙</p><p>在這張罕見曝光的近照中，丁小芹展示一頭長髮整齊全後梳髮型，大方露出精緻的五官輪廓。她臉上佩戴著知性風格的半眉框眼鏡，身上並無過多華麗妝飾，卻反而襯托出白皙透亮的肌膚。</p><p>久未面對鏡頭的她，狀態依舊維持得相當好，歲月似乎並未在她臉上留下太多痕跡。這次難得「營業」，主要是為了宣傳包包。她還親自擔任模特兒捧着包款拍照。</p><p>英文留言疑感謝好友不離不棄</p><p>除此之外，丁小芹在貼文中所附上的英文文案，寫道：</p><blockquote><p>True friendship resists time, distance, and silence. Growing apart doesn't change the fact that for a long time we grew side by side; our roots will always be tangled.（真正的友誼能抵擋時間、距離與沉默。即使漸行漸遠，也無法改變我們曾並肩成長的事實；我們的根將永遠緊緊相連。）</p></blockquote><p>這段感性的文字，似乎在對多年來對她不離不棄的摯友們表達由衷的感謝。如今的丁小芹卸下昔日明星光環，在電商界默默耕耘，用全新的姿態活出新篇章。</p><p>延伸閲讀：空姐怒轟資深女歌手尖酸刻薄　網一致猜測是蔡琴　更有加碼爆料</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：空姐怒轟資深女歌手尖酸刻薄　網一致猜測是蔡琴　更有加碼爆料】蔡琴遭影射態度差.（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20141225/1419475444549b79f476ce0.jpg/21doBqYL3-XRgLwDzaQoYc_k790f2QG71TpU1dU6VNU\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：空姐怒轟資深女歌手尖酸刻薄　網一致猜測是蔡琴　更有加碼爆料】蔡琴遭影射態度差.（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186278738737106944298647.jpeg/JFGm4BPYzUvFsaIeL03OXxYyqaVXAhX-gtApTYLQKU0\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186278734542540800502431.jpeg/i_pZcfD7nre-BNwdtKDscRcd7_j5voedB3ZgMAd2YDA\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240527/871911864169140224965208.jpeg/S_YWPuVd0Kycr9UpGHStAnGmdh39c7kjbOWcSVblnEk\"/><figcaption>蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186278736690155520026571.jpeg/GQmB7Pu5iatmXR3pNfPyUwYLDVvlu9b8Z2VcrmdlXK4\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240527/871911528637403136807253.jpeg/B5VRvfOkSpc0kDcEAbm7F-lPfmD01xj2aup3v1Dqd78\"/><figcaption>蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186278732210376704069421.jpeg/okvLmM7ZCHe-_RNkiJegeqjJFzNnM-KDsXvzp7F786c\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（蔡琴微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655052318684745728342678.jpeg/pGh68W35AWYq6N9q-3HJ0l_nM1q_KbBE1B6_6NQev-g\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（蔡琴微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240527/871912922870190080951073.jpeg/ogF6Ez-Cjhp6u_cCPVytEoTFV-1dOmHMSa-UIHOvlCA\"/><figcaption>蔡琴(陳順禎 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡琴（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240324/848676453523394560480739.jpeg/koQ-sZtelgsUxa2wyzu8lVtLWDnUT6fvfDtyWUo7clk\"/><figcaption>蔡琴（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:22:18.756214+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1270,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:16.331120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:17.389649+00:00","content_hash":"4d4e046a855a2e7a543ea3c28049e4e7ccd286e05664786e68f0281cd5153c60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}